  + [text] is "I'm starting to think about upgrading Cantor to become it's own full-blown language model, as I've had the idea to build a language model around the noun, verb, and their relationships. and I had thought to make it with a diffusion model that attacks articles first, resolving nouns and verbs last when the last ambiguities dissolve."

